      "message": "Zephyr\u0027s convention is that there is a Kconfig symbol for each \"significant\" library.  \n\nBody detection V2 should select the Kconfig symbols to enable the libraries it needs.",
      "revId": "224bccfad97a3610f871530d09a926f03c1cdea7",
