      "writtenOn": "2025-06-24T16:08:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, Zephyr does that because they automatically link the libraries into Zephyr so there\u0027s a cost to using `zephyr_library`. `pw_add_library` just declares the library and doesn\u0027t link it to anything. The final linking is done in the top CL. So these are effectively no-ops until we link them.",
      "parentUuid": "1643d8e6_e68fc1f2",
